<title>USA: Dow Industrials open lower.</title>
<headline>Dow Industrials open lower.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow Industrials opened lower on Thursday with bonds in a followthrough to Wednesday's downward momentum.</p>
<p>The Dow Industrial Average was down 11 at 7002.</p>
</text>
